Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:44.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}胎儿已然显现出男性特征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The child had the appearance of a male,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:46.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约有四个月大小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about four months old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:51.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}胎儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The foetus...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:57.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有畸形的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there were signs of deformity, of abnormality.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:01.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps,after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:05.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后的流产未尝不是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Queen's miscarriage was a blessing in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:24.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:45.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 大使先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Madame. - Monsieur Ambassadeur...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:50.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我请求你 务必说服弗兰西斯国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you: King Francis must be persuaded
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:53.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恩准我女儿伊丽莎白与贵国王子的婚事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to accept the marriage of his son to our daughter Elizabeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:55.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使我不至于被废黜或失宠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so that I may not be ruined or lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:02:59.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很清楚自己即将陷入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for I see myself very near that and in more trouble and grief than
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:01.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前所未有的悲惨与不幸之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was ever in before my marriage...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:04.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在无法对你和盘托出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot speak to you more fully now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:07.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亦不敢将忧惧付诸书简 但请求您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nor dare I express my fears in writing. But please,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}念在我为法国所做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after everything I've done for France,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:13.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果拥戴我 就请务必倾尽全力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you love me,do the best you can for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:16.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.73,0:03:24.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华·西摩阁下到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Edward Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:32.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 西摩少爷 - 大臣阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Master Seymour. - Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.07,0:03:33.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们对彼此不甚了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't know each other well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.57,0:03:35.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们会相熟起来 我深信不疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we shall. I have every confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:38.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下欲任命你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is His Majesty's pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:41.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为枢密侍郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to appoint you a Gentleman of the Privy Chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:44.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此一来便可每日伴驾于陛下左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In that capacity,you will attend His Majesty daily,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:47.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听候陛下差遣 你日后会明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and as he sees fit to use you. It is,you will understand that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:50.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个很特殊 拥有特权的职位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a special and privileged position.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:54.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大臣阁下 我不胜荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I am deeply honored, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:01.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is... one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下向我暗示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty has indicated to me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:07.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有意追求令妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he would like to pay court to your sister,from time to time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:11.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但为避免有关二人的流言蜚语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}although to avoid any scandal attaching himself to your sister's name
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:13.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们只会在有家人在场的情况下相见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only in the presence of a member,or members, of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:16.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此 我非常乐于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In which case, I am more than happy to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:17.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向你及你的家人提供便利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}offer you and your family
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:20.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让出我在宫中的私人房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my private chambers in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:23.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此房间恰好与国王私人房间相邻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As it happens,they are adjacent to the King's private chambers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:26.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之间以走廊衔接 以保私密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the connecting gallery for greater privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:28.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大臣阁下甚是慷慨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are most generous, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:32.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信家父定会报答您的好意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sure my father will like to repay your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:39.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把你的房间让给西摩家了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've given the Seymours your rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.77,0:04:41.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.31,0:04:43.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蠢材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已御准革除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have just given royal assent to the Act stripping
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:49.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}林恩镇诺里奇的主教职位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the bishopric of Norwich of the town of Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:55.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任命托马斯·波林 威尔特郡伯爵为新的继任者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The new beneficiary is to be Thomas Boleyn, Earl of Wiltshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:58.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有意赐他两所解散的修道院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I also intend giving him two of the dissolved abbeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:03.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}务必向他转达这个好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must inform him of his good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:04.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:11.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要确保无人知晓我们的计划 克伦威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one must know our plans, Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:21.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来 珍 让我看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here,Jane. Let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:29.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真是美极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How beautiful you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:34.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 准备好了吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Ready? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:37.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:54.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 珍 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Jane. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:58.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有件东西要给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:10.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:18.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.97,0:06:23.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将永生珍藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will treasure this all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:29.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}藏于我心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if they ever open my grave, they will find it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:32.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至死不渝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}right next to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:51.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:06.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不明白他为什么到现在还不向玛琪求婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder why,after all this time,he still will not marry Madge?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:08.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为诺里斯与其说是为玛琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think Norris comes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:11.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不如说是为陛下而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into your chamber more for Your Majesty than he does for Madge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:15.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 为我？- 正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- For me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.57,0:07:23.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔的房间？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Cromwell's rooms? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:42.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:47.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个盒式挂件 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a locket,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:50.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:57.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我看清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:02.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大臣阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Secretary!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:08.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:13.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有好消息向您禀报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have some good news for Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国会已经通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Bill for the dissolution
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.35,0:09:16.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解散大型修道院的法案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the large monasteries has just been passed Parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:19.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的改革进展迅速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our reformation is moving apace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:24.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大臣阁下 听闻约克郡的索里修道院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been told privately, Mr. Secretary,that the King has already sold
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:28.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已由某朝臣买下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sawley Abbey in Yorkshire to one of his courtiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.27,0:09:31.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管这项法案还没有列入法令全书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even though the Bill has not yet reached the statute book,and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:33.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仅仅是基于你的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}plainly on your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:37.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们改革的初衷并非为个人敛财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our reformation was never meant to be about personal gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:40.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}修道院不应出售\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Religious houses should not be sold off
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:42.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而应加以善用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but converted to better uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:45.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:49.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没收的财产仍将用于供奉上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the confiscated assets will be used to the pleasure of Almighty God
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.63,0:09:51.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}造福国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to the profit of this realm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.29,0:09:53.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然现在我们微不足道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which is but a pygmy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:56.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他日定当富敌西班牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but will one day be greater even than Spain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:02.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说 你把私人房间让给西摩家是真的了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So is it true you have given your private rooms here to the Seymours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:11.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是堂堂英格兰王后 回答我 是否属实？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am the Queen of England. You will answer me. Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 确有其事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:18.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你太目中无人了 克伦威尔阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have over-reached yourself, Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:23.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信我 你已危在旦夕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Believe me,you have placed yourself in very great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:28.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你相信我说的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.59,0:10:32.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是你认为我已经无力毁掉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or do you assume I no longer posses the power to crush you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:38.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你就大错特错了 克伦威尔阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would be an easy mistake to make,Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:56.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想应当物归原主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you might like this returned to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:00.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:09.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good evening Your Excellency,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:12.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进 请让我为您收好帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please,may I take your hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:23.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帝国大使阁下来访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Excellency the Imperial Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.61,0:11:28.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤斯塔斯 您不辞辛劳前往沟岸区真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah,Eustace. It's so good of you to come all the way to Shoreditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:30.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信我 大臣阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Believe me,Mr. Secretary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:33.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能有幸与您相谈 走再远的路我都愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would travel a great deal further for the pleasure of talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恕我直言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I be blunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:49.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你与王后吵翻 可有此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it true that you have fallen out with Queen Anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:51.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确有此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她对我恨之入骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe she hates me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.97,0:11:57.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想置我于死地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wants to have me executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不惧怕吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you not afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:01.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:04.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我充分信任我的主上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No I trust my master so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:08.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为她不能把我怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fancy she can't do me any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:10.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论如何 我惟愿你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nevertheless, I cannot but wish you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:13.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有个宽厚仁慈的女主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a more gracious mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:15.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个更加感激你为陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One more grateful for the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:18.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鞠躬尽瘁的女主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}inestimable service you have done the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.07,0:12:21.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是随便说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the sake of argument,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:28.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}假设国王正在考虑另立新后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}suppose the King was considering taking another wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:32.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这对他非常有利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would certainly be to his advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:34.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For here is a King
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:38.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对无法生下男性子嗣大失所望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who has so far been disappointed of male issue,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:40.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也深知目前这段婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and who knows very well that his present marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:43.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远不会得到法律认可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will never be held as lawful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.89,0:12:49.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下请你进宫见驾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king requests your presence at the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:53.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信他想与皇帝陛下缔结新的联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sure he wishes to confirm a new alliance with the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:57.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至于其他的意思 我不敢妄断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What else he means to tell you,I cannot guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:12:59.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么我热切期待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I look forward
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:02.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谒见陛下 大臣阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}eagerly to finding out, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:19.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:23.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洛克福特夫人求见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:25.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洛克福特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Rochford,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:27.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么我能做的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.31,0:13:30.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请让您的弟弟对我体贴一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You could ask your brother to be kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:33.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他冷酷至极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is cruel in every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:35.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得了 我不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come now... I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.28,0:13:40.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他另结新欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are others he has preferred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:45.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小声点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hush!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:47.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:50.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他没有把我当作妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He does not treat me as his proper wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:53.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如国王待你这般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the King treats you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:56.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来告诉你吧 洛克福特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me tell you something, Lady Rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:59.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王根本不能满足一个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King cannot satisfy a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:02.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他既无能 也无力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has neither the skill, nor the virility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:19.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须放弃与法国结盟的念头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must give up the idea of a French alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:23.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王似乎执意反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King seems implacably against it,just as he seems
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:26.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他越来越倾向于与神圣罗马帝国结盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}more and more inclined to embrace a new alliance with the Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:28.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在听我说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:29.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:32.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来众臣都更支持与帝国结盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems that most of the country is still in favor
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:34.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倘若我们逆流而行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of an Imperial alliance, so it would serve us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:36.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将无任何益处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nothing to swim against the tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:38.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:44.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帝国大使已经应邀入宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Imperial Ambassador is to be received at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:46.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应殷勤款待之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will make a great fuss of him. In the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:48.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先 请他吻你的脸颊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by inviting him to kiss your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:51.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后 你和国王将与他共进晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you and the King will dine with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.67,0:14:53.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要在其他使臣面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you will say some harsh things against the French
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:56.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}竭力批判法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the presence of the other ambassadors say how they
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:58.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}背信弃义 两面三刀之类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have betrayed your trust,are hypocrites and false friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:02.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 所有你能想到的类似言辞 - 是 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Whatever you can think of. - Yes Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:09.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮 我们已经走到这步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne,we have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:15.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不容任何人毁灭我们的基业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one is going to be allowed to destroy us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:17.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:21.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:27.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:50.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帝国大使阁下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Excellency, the Imperial Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:55.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.59,0:15:58.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王与王后陛下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their gracious Majesties
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:31.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弥撒之后 乔普斯先生会和我们一起用餐吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After Mass, Mr.Chapuys is sure to dine with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:38.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:42.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有更好的理由他是不会留下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not without good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:47.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马克 要出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something is happening, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:49.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是我不知道是什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:37.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eminency,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:40.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道在过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know that, in the past, there have been
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:43.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您和我们家族之间存有误会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}misunderstandings between my family and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:46.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某些言辞过激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some intemperate words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一些事不应提及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Certain things that should not have been said,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.34,0:17:50.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们对此追悔不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and are now regretted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:52.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们同身处现实之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we both live in a real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.69,0:17:55.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理应通关达变 适时交友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must take our friends as we find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:17:58.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道皇帝陛下非常热衷于保持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know the Emperor is keen to protect
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:18:00.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他与英格兰的贸易往来关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his lucrative trade links with England.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:02.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而显然我的家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And obviously my family is in a position
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:04.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以助他一臂之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to help and assist him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:07.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们也正决定要这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which is what we are determined to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:10.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我们为何不一杯泯恩仇 重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So I think we should drink a toast to new beginnings,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:14.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们为友谊干杯 扶持共进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and new friendships and to a mutually beneficial future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:17.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 干杯 - 干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Salut. - Salut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:19.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Salut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:35.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请问阁下从哪儿来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And where are you from, Excellency?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.04,0:18:39.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为身为米兰大使而自豪 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am proud to be the Ambassador from Milan, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:41.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, Milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:43.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们过去被法国占领了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were you not occupied by the French?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:46.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其实 我们仍然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alas, we are still
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:48.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被法国的军队占领着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}occupied by French troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:50.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你一定同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you will agree with me that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:52.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国人事事欺诈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the French are deceitful in everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:55.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 在场的哪位能告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In fact, can anyone here tell me that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:58.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国人是地道的谎言家和伪君子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the French are anything but liars and hypocrites?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:01.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们说过真话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do they ever tell the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.37,0:19:03.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们尊重过多少条约？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many treaties do they honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:05.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们信守过多少诺言？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how many promises do they keep?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:19.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生 发生了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell, what is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:21.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下要接见大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty will soon be having an audience with
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:23.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这正是我们期待的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Ambassador. That's what we're waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.21,0:19:30.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Excellency,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:32.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请随我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.23,0:19:35.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:45.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.78,0:19:52.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说你的主人希望缔结盟约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hear your master is anxious for an alliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.45,0:19:55.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是的 陛下 - 有何条件？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He is, Your Majesty. - On what terms?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.12,0:19:58.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如克伦威尔阁下所述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On such terms as Mr. Cromwell has outlined to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:02.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英国与罗马帝国之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The restoration of some relation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:03.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重修旧好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}between England and Rome,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:06.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将玛丽女士列为顺位继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the inclusion of the Lady Mary in the line of succession,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:08.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及支持皇帝陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and support for the Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.15,0:20:10.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与法国争夺米兰的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in his war with France over Milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就玛丽女士的事而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As far as the Lady Mary is concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.17,0:20:16.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许上帝之所以不肯赐予陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it may be that God has not thought to send Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:20.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个男性子嗣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a male issue because he believes that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.19,0:20:23.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是因为他深信英格兰将由女性来继承\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}England should have a female succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:30.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你凭何如此妄断 阁下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you alleging, Excellency?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:33.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和其他男人有何不同？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I not a man as other men?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.47,0:20:37.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.36,0:20:40.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}AM I NOT?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:44.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你并不知悉我所有的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do not know all my secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:59.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要求皇帝开出的所有条件都付诸书面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want everything in writing. The Emperor's offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:02.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 一切都付诸书面 - 那不可能 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Everything in writing. - That is not possible, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:07.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当我是三岁毛孩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think I am a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.63,0:21:10.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先行责打再来好言安抚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be first whipped and then petted?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.43,0:21:14.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你主人想要和我谈协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If your master wants to deal with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:15.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他必须先道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he must first apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:17.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为以往对我的不公对待赔不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for all his ill-treatment on me in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他必须承认安妮为王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He must accept Queen Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.63,0:21:26.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对你的主人 就说这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have nothing more to say to your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:40.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王公贵族与我们不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Princes are different from us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.89,0:21:42.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的想法旁人很难理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and are not to be easily understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:44.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.34,0:22:06.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Grace. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:09.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为您的老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As your oldest friend
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.37,0:22:11.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和最忠心的部下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as well as your most loyal subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.81,0:22:14.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得无论多痛苦 我都有责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel it's my duty, however painful
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:17.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向您禀明一些实情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to report some truths to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.39,0:22:21.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"真实？" 善戏谑的比拉多曾说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Truth?", said jesting Pilate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.73,0:22:23.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"什么是真实？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"What is truth?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:29.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于王后的行为举止有些流言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are rumors about the Queen's behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.49,0:22:31.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.40,0:22:34.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在自己的房内招待男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she entertains men in her rooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:38.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他们调情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}flirts
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:42.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且言行亲昵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and behaves intimately with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.46,0:22:53.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位大人 这个王国正处于危险之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords, this kingdom is in peril and in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:54.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些危险并不是来自外国势力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But not by some foreign power
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.03,0:22:57.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或反抗我们的邪恶力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or strangers with evil intent against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:22:59.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我注意到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has come to my notice
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:02.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某些叛国行为 和其他罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that some acts of treason, and other offences,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.21,0:23:04.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自于我们所爱和信任的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have been committed by those we loved and trusted,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.89,0:23:07.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自于宫廷之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by members of our own court.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.48,0:23:09.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞奇先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Rich,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:11.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为副总检察长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as Solicitor General
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:14.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我任命你和克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am appointing you and Mr. Cromwell
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.30,0:23:17.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来总负责这次审理和判决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to head a commission of oyer and terminer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.24,0:23:19.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来查明这些罪行是否属实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to investigate whether or not these offences be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:27.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}日安 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good day, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:35.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢尔登女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Sheldon,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:37.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我特此提醒你 今天的谈话内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I warn you not to repeat to anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.63,0:23:40.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}决不准对任何人提及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what passes between us here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.93,0:23:46.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和王后陛下住得很近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You live in close proximity with Her Majesty the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.49,0:23:48.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有没有见过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you ever seen her
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.42,0:23:50.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在房间内招待男性客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}entertain men in her chambers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且有些你认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in what you would consider
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.98,0:23:55.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不当的行为？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an inappropriate way?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.75,0:24:01.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:05.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.68,0:24:08.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.18,0:24:12.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须提醒你 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must warn you, my Lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.10,0:24:14.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些隐瞒事情真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that those concealing the truth from those
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.28,0:24:16.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阻碍国王调查的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}commissioned by the King to discover it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.19,0:24:19.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将被视为欺君之罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are themselves guilty of treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.14,0:24:21.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并极有可能处以绞刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and are very likely to be hanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.75,0:24:30.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.00,0:24:36.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}珍 由于各种原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jane. For very good reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.42,0:24:38.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你能离开白厅一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to leave Whitehall for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:41.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 和你父亲一起回家去 - 我会走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Go back home with your father. - I will leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:42.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论陛下要我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I will do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.01,0:24:44.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都会照做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty commands me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.36,0:24:47.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想告诉你 在这个狡诈的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to tell you that in this slippery world,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.28,0:24:50.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你展现给我的一切都是那么纯真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you represent for me all that is innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.13,0:24:51.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都那么美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}everything that is good,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.45,0:24:53.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么纯洁无瑕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unsullied,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.04,0:24:55.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不被世俗污染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}uncorrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.24,0:25:01.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会让你久等的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will not be for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.75,0:25:03.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那之后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.15,0:25:08.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那之后 我们就能遵从内心的渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After that we can have our hearts' desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.22,0:25:13.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:20.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.90,0:25:22.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.57,0:25:26.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确有男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's true that some men
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.27,0:25:28.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在不恰当的时间造访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}came into the Queen's chambers...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.90,0:25:30.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at undue hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.98,0:25:33.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时王后挑逗他们 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And sometimes she flirted with them but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.98,0:25:35.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are their names?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.05,0:25:41.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自然有… 洛克福特大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Rochford... of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.31,0:25:43.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.66,0:25:46.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有亨利·诺里斯阁下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Sir Henry Norris...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.83,0:25:48.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.88,0:25:53.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王的贴身侍从 布里列顿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King's groom,Brereton...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.68,0:25:55.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.66,0:25:58.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乐师马克·斯米顿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mark Smeaton,the musician...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.43,0:26:01.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.21,0:26:03.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.71,0:26:09.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看见王后拥抱亲吻她的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,I saw her hugging and kissing her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.75,0:26:16.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她弟弟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:21.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我也没多想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But thought nothing of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.71,0:26:36.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得这是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you believe this to be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.71,0:26:41.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信这是真的 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe that is true,yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.58,0:26:49.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你相信你的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You believe that your husband
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.39,0:26:52.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和王后乱伦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has committed incest with the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.54,0:27:04.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.96,0:27:07.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.31,0:27:14.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah! Mr. Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.55,0:27:18.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我何以如此荣幸 蒙您接见？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to what do I owe this great pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.11,0:27:33.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘘… 冷静点 斯米顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shhh... Calm Mr. Smeaton.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.07,0:27:39.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey! Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.52,0:27:41.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想知道你是什么时候开始和王后通奸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to know when you slept with the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.07,0:27:42.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一共几次？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And how many times you slept with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.93,0:27:45.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没和王后上过床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never slept with the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.48,0:27:48.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没和王后上过床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never slept with the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.31,0:27:51.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不明白 克伦威尔阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't understand. Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:57.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说实话吧 我想听实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You gonna have to tell the truth. I want the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.76,0:27:59.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然 上帝作证 后果很严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or God help me it will go badly with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.67,0:28:01.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向全能的上帝发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear by Almighty God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.66,0:28:04.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没和王后陛下上过床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never slept with Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.93,0:28:06.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别伤害我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't do anything to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.83,0:28:08.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你只不过是个小小乐师但最近却\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are only a poor musician and yet recently
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.88,0:28:11.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}花费大笔金钱购置马匹 为仆人置装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you spent a great deal of money on horses and liveries for your servants!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.99,0:28:13.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从哪弄来的钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where did you get the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.96,0:28:15.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是侍奉王后的的报酬吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it for services rendered?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.99,0:28:17.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向全能的上帝发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear to God Almighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.18,0:28:20.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没和王后陛下上过床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never slept with Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.39,0:28:36.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们开始…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Off we go,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.46,0:28:40.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 加快些…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,quicker then... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.20,0:28:44.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一 二 三 四…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One,two,three,four...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.01,0:28:53.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢尔登女士 我相信你已经掌握要领了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Sheldon! I believe you know what you are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.76,0:28:58.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 左臂… 像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}OK. Left arm... comme a.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.92,0:29:01.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前 后 后跳…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forward,back,and after spring...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.69,0:29:05.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.53,0:29:13.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和国王出访法国的计划推迟一周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your visit to France with the King is postponed for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.75,0:29:15.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.27,0:29:17.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有些别的事情…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And there's something else...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.08,0:29:20.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马克·斯米顿被逮捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mark Smeaton is arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.41,0:29:24.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 所为何事？- 我们还不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What for? - We don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.11,0:29:26.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.45,0:30:10.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利爵士 你又来这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Henry,you are here again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.53,0:30:14.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有勇气迎娶一位女士吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you never seem to have the courage to marry the Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.20,0:30:16.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.46,0:30:18.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}婚姻大事不可操之过急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}marriage is not something to hurry into.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.12,0:30:21.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我知道真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.40,0:30:23.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在等着"穿破鞋"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You look for dead men's shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.31,0:30:26.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人？我真得抗议了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam? I really must protest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.47,0:30:28.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说 假如国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean,you suppose that if anything bad
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.37,0:30:30.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发生什么意外 你就可拥有我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}happen to the King, then you would think to have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.36,0:30:33.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 假若我曾有一丝歹念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam,if I ever had such a thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.64,0:30:35.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我愿砍下自己的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then I wish my head were cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.75,0:30:38.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这事可以安排啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,that could be arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.83,0:30:53.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nan,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.83,0:30:56.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.30,0:30:58.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他们明天把伊丽莎白接来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get them to fetch Elizabeth to me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:30:59.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想见我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to see my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.50,0:31:02.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 知道了 夫人 - 还有 南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes,Madam. - And,Nan,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.61,0:31:06.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}万一我有什么不测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if anything should happen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.49,0:31:10.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能答应替我照顾她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would you promise to care for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.49,0:31:11.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.93,0:31:34.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯米顿先生 你迟早会告诉我们真相的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sooner or later,Mr. Smeaton, you will tell us the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.94,0:31:36.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.51,0:31:38.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这不是真的 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- It's not true. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.43,0:31:42.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这不是真的 - 什么？- 这不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- It's not true. - What? - It's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.96,0:32:18.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王已经召集国会召开紧急会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King has called an emergency meeting of the Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.92,0:32:20.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怎么没接到通知？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why wasn't I told?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.18,0:32:22.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我也没有接到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because I wasn't told either!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.91,0:32:27.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 你给我时刻盯着国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For God's sake, make sure you keep the King always in your sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.46,0:32:29.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:31.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔阁下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell approaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.19,0:32:40.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯米顿已经招供了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Smeaton has confessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.93,0:32:48.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 亨利爵士… - 是的 - 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Sir Henry... - Sir.  - Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.59,0:33:05.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知不知道王后再度怀孕？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you know the Queen was pregnant again?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.29,0:33:08.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 陛下 我怎么会知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,your Majesty! How should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.97,0:33:10.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为你可能就是孩子的父亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because you may be the child's father...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.97,0:33:14.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很多人都已作证 你是那么爱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since you love her so well, as many have testified.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.05,0:33:17.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下这可太荒谬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty is being ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.21,0:33:23.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在你眼里就是个荒谬的家伙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So then I'm a figure of ridicule to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:26.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侍卫 逮捕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Guards! Arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.07,0:33:29.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他押送至伦敦塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take him to the Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.45,0:33:32.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下… 陛下… 陛下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty... Majesty... Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.26,0:33:38.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为上帝所眷顾 圣洁的玛利亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Benedicta et venerabilis es,virgo Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.86,0:33:42.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成为我主的生母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in tua se clausit viscera, facta homo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.17,0:33:45.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她将世界生的希望孕育在自己体内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dei genitrix intercede pro nobis.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.74,0:33:47.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 奉圣父… - 布里列顿阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- In nomine Patris et Filii... - Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.63,0:33:49.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奉国王之命 现以叛国罪逮捕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by order of the King you are arrested for High Treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.74,0:33:51.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣子 圣灵之名 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Et Spiritus Sancti. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.07,0:34:15.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要去哪 陛下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are you going,my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.06,0:34:19.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我要见国王 - 太晚了 乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I have to see the King. - It's too late,George.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.34,0:34:21.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为时已晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Much too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.34,0:34:26.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 托马斯爵士…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord... Sir Thomas...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.60,0:34:28.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以叛国罪 及与王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are both arrested for High Treason,and having
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.91,0:34:31.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通奸罪逮捕二位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}carnal knowledge of her Majesty the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.21,0:34:33.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.95,0:34:50.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.93,0:34:53.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.48,0:34:56.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在你对孩子的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the love you bear our child.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.59,0:34:57.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在对伊丽莎白的爱… 仁慈些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the love of Elizabeth...have mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.71,0:35:00.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你跟我撒谎 你总是撒谎 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You lied to me. You have always lied to me. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.52,0:35:02.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你嫁给我时已不是处子之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were not a virgin when you married me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.21,0:35:04.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你表里不一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were not what you seemed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.16,0:35:06.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你父亲和你弟弟安排了这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father and your brother arranged everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.33,0:35:09.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我深爱着你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I loved you...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.30,0:35:13.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我始终爱着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I loved you and I love you still.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.40,0:35:15.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你了 看在曾经的你我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please after everything we have been to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.41,0:35:18.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在我们一起经历了这么多的份上 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After everything we were. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.15,0:35:28.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再给我一次机会 就一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One more chance... One more...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.57,0:35:32.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.38,0:35:37.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.12,0:35:41.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我恳求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty... I beseech you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.56,0:35:53.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你清楚自己被捕的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know why you have been arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.62,0:35:58.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你同你姐姐通奸乱伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not enough that you commit vile incest on your sister the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.25,0:36:01.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们互相亲吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her tongue in your mouth,your tongue in hers,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.55,0:36:06.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}违背上帝的旨意…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against the commands of God Almighty...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.63,0:36:12.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还密谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you must plot regicide
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.17,0:36:14.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大逆弑君之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.24,0:36:16.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尔后 安妮就能堂而皇之地和她某个情人完婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so that Anne could marry one of her lover's
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.38,0:36:19.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}代她的野种摄政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and rule as regent for her bastard child.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.07,0:36:27.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.26,0:36:31.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的话令我费解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You baffle me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.38,0:36:33.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的敌人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.54,0:36:35.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}散布了可怕的谎话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have poisoned the air with their horrid lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.93,0:36:39.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管我姐姐做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever my sister has done,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.43,0:36:41.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都与我无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is not with me,or mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.17,0:36:48.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是无辜的 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am innocent,Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.71,0:36:51.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:54.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以主耶稣基督的宝血起誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear on the blood of Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.81,0:36:58.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是无辜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.69,0:37:02.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.16,0:37:07.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我 布里列顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me,Mr. Brereton
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.84,0:37:09.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否曾经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}did you ever have
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.84,0:37:12.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与王后陛下有过苟合之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}carnal knowledge of the Queen's Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.53,0:37:24.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.01,0:37:35.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我招认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.22,0:37:41.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我绝对要谴责他们 所有那些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I condemn them utterly. All those men,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.92,0:37:43.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论他们等级和身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whatever their rank or station...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.70,0:37:47.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论他们等级和身份…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whatever their rank or station,who...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.76,0:37:50.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些背叛国王与之合法妻子苟合之流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}deceived the King and slipped between the sheets with his lawful wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.79,0:37:52.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.44,0:37:55.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我绝对地…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}utterly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.97,0:37:58.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对这种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For such
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.25,0:38:01.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无比卑劣的通奸行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}awful adultery,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.70,0:38:03.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应当只有一种处罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there should be only one punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.05,0:38:38.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人们 所为何事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords,why have you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.41,0:38:41.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此为您的逮捕状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the warrant for your arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.06,0:38:44.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你被指控与马克·斯米顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are charged with committing adultery with Mark Smeaton,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.88,0:38:46.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利·诺里斯爵士 威廉·布里列顿通奸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Henry Norris and William Brereton.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.87,0:38:49.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯米顿与布里列顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Both Smeaton and Brereton
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.48,0:38:51.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都已认罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have already confessed their guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.50,0:38:53.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现奉国王之命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are come at the King's command
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.27,0:38:56.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将你押送至伦敦塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to conduct you to the Tower,there to abide
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.42,0:38:58.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}静候陛下发落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}during His Majesty's pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.08,0:39:04.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果此为陛下的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it be His Majesty's pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.98,0:39:08.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我谨遵圣旨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then I am ready to obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.28,0:39:11.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 谢尔登女士… - 无须劳烦更衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Lady Sh... - There is no time to change your clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.92,0:39:13.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或打点行装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or pack any of your things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.93,0:39:16.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伦敦塔里自会为您提供所需金钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Money will be provided for your needs at the Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.50,0:39:46.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人们 在你们离开之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords,I beg you,before you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.57,0:39:48.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求你们 请在国王御前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to beseech the King's Grace
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.01,0:39:49.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}代我好言祈求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.59,0:39:53.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 请您这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madame,this way,I pray you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.78,0:40:15.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我祈求上帝拯救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray God will help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.85,0:40:17.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些指控都是无中生有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for there is no truth in these allegations.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.48,0:40:19.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.58,0:40:32.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是国王明媒正娶的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am the King's true wedded wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.95,0:40:36.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并未犯下指控的这些罪名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am not guilty of these charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.03,0:40:41.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未相伴过任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am as free from the company of man
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.28,0:40:42.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不曾有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as I am from sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.64,0:40:54.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是要去地牢吗 金斯顿先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do I go into a dungeon, Mr. Kingston?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.60,0:40:58.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 夫人 房间已经为您备妥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,Madam. There are lodgings made ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.55,0:41:03.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是受宠若惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's too good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.75,0:41:07.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请耶稣怜悯我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jesus have mercy on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.75,0:41:11.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.15,0:41:19.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可否在我房间放置圣餐礼台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I have the Holy Sacrament placed in my room,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.29,0:41:21.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以求怜悯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I may pray for mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.47,0:41:34.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.73,0:41:43.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.59,0:41:46.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刚听闻王后被捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have just heard of the Queen's arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.64,0:41:48.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对此无比震惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My mind is clean amazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.76,0:41:52.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法相信她能犯下如此滔天罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot believe that she is guilty of such abominable crimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.38,0:42:00.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但同时我也并不认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet I cannot think
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.10,0:42:02.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王会采取这么坚决的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the King would have proceeded so far
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.30,0:42:04.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倘若她是无辜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unless she was culpable.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.14,0:42:06.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}揭穿她的谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has caused both the King and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.59,0:42:09.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}令国王与我本人痛苦不堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A great pain to discover her deceit...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.37,0:42:11.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她竟然堕落如斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the depth of her depravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.98,0:42:16.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔阁下 事实是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fact is, Mr. Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.45,0:42:18.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对她的爱戴并非仅仅因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I loved her not a little for the love
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.95,0:42:21.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认定她承载着上帝和福音之爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which I judged her to bear towards God and the Gospel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.92,0:42:24.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}芸芸众生中除了国王陛下与您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Next to his grace the King,and yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.14,0:42:27.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最拜服于她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was most bound to her of all creatures living.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.85,0:42:30.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你要学着适应没有她的日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you must learn to live without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.28,0:42:33.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但没有她 我们的改革不会陷入危机吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But,without her,is not our reformation in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.84,0:42:36.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不是我们最大的支持者与拥护者吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was she not our great supporter and advocate?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.27,0:42:38.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也最有可能成为我们最大的累赘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who would likely have become our greatest liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.34,0:42:42.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时候 大人 为了战胜邪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sometimes,Your Grace, in order to defeat evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.39,0:42:44.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须先学会与恶魔为伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one must learn to consort with the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.54,0:42:49.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下正在等待大人您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty is waiting for Your Grace
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.72,0:42:51.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去找出一个理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to discover a reason why his marriage to Anne Boleyn
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.95,0:42:54.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}判定他与安妮·波林的婚姻无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}should be considered null and void.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.17,0:42:57.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他期待您尽快裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He expects your verdict presently.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.45,0:43:23.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他人怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.78,0:43:26.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯米顿 布里列顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Smeaton,Brereton,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.23,0:43:28.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺里斯 乔治·波林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Norris and George Boleyn
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.83,0:43:30.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经判决 罪名成立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have been found guilty...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.45,0:43:33.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明日处决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and are to be executed tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.00,0:43:40.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道克伦威尔告诉我什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what Cromwell told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.23,0:43:45.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他告诉我她睡过上百个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He told me she had to do with over a hundred men!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.22,0:43:50.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上百个该死的男人 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A hundred fucking men,Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.35,0:43:55.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.07,0:44:01.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道吗 我的女儿 玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what? My daughter, Mary,owes God a great deal
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.78,0:44:04.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多亏上帝庇护才免遭那个恶妇的毒手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for escaping the hands of that poisoning whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.03,0:44:07.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她计划生下个祸根 确有此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She planned to have a poisoned child... It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.65,0:44:09.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如他毒害了凯瑟琳一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just like she poisoned Katharine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.49,0:44:12.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.86,0:44:14.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的胎儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.53,0:44:17.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的胎儿是畸形的 你知道吗 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her baby was deformed. Did you know that Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.19,0:44:21.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以那怎么可能是我的骨肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So how it couldn't have been mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.35,0:44:28.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许伊丽莎白也不是我的骨肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps Elizabeth isn't even mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.79,0:44:32.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个臭婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That fucking bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.20,0:45:02.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们昨天在威斯敏斯特大厅对王后进行了审讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Queen was tried yesterday at Westminster Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.40,0:45:05.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她对所有被控罪行一律否认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She pleaded not guilty to all the charges against her
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.81,0:45:07.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但证据确凿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the evidence being overwhelming,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.05,0:45:09.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她已被判处死刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she was sentenced to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.45,0:45:11.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至于是斩首还是烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}either by burning or by decapitation,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.16,0:45:13.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}取决于国王的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}according to the King's pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.47,0:45:29.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那她的同谋呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And her accomplices?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.93,0:45:32.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如何处置我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.61,0:45:36.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯米顿 布兰顿 诺里斯 乔治·波林都被判有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Smeaton,Brereton, Norris and George Boleyn, all guilty as charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.52,0:45:44.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯 我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas,what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.81,0:45:46.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是否也要去受审\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I to be tried too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.66,0:45:52.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我们并未发现不利于你的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. We found no evidence against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.51,0:45:54.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将被释放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are to be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.97,0:46:02.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是最终判决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.64,0:46:09.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是唯一有罪的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am the only one who is guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.71,0:47:11.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请听我一言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.65,0:47:15.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请听我说 相信上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say to you trust in God,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.40,0:47:18.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要相信这世间的浮华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and not in the vanities of this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.06,0:47:21.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倘若当初如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for if I had done so,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.45,0:47:24.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可能还像你们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think I would still be alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.08,0:47:27.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}依然存活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.31,0:48:24.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh God...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.54,0:49:23.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}血腥时日令吾心碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These bloody days have broken my heart:
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.63,0:49:26.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}活力青春已逝不回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lust,my youth did them depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.27,0:49:31.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世人嗟叹惟君有识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For your wit alone,many men would bemoan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.45,0:49:35.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诚然至此啼声鸣悲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And since it is so, many still cry loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.78,0:49:39.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}香消玉损芳魂何归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a great loss that you are dead and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.20,0:49:49.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾几何时高攀枝头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The time you had about above your poor degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.57,0:49:53.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一朝跌落朋比追悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fall whereof your friends may well bemoan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.39,0:49:58.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}高不胜寒枯木难支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A rotten twig upon so high a tree
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.14,0:50:04.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}君心难测命丧魂飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has slipped your hold, and you are dead. And gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.72,0:50:26.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}血腥时日令吾心碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These bloody days have broken my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.44,0:50:32.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欲望青春远走高飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lust. My youth did them depart,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.87,0:50:35.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}野心悸动贪欲可窥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and blind desire of ambitious souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.96,0:50:41.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}攀龙附凤终得报应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who hastes to climb seeks to revert:
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.78,0:50:47.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王座之上雷霆尽摧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And about the throne the thunder rolls.
